<title>USA: Response Oncology Inc Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>Response Oncology Inc Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>MEMPHIS, Tenn. 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended</p>
<p>					    Sep 30, 1996   Sep 30, 1995</p>
<p> Net revenue			     $17,913,611    $11,221,751</p>
<p> Net earnings				  674,253	  604,803</p>
<p> Earnings per common share		    0.08	     0.08</p>
<p>Weighted average number of</p>
<p>  common shares			    8,391,461	7,618,730</p>
<p>						     Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>					  Sept. 30, 1996 Sept. 30, 1995</p>
<p> Net revenue			     $46,353,078    $33,795,022</p>
<p> Net earnings				1,734,907	2,162,150</p>
<p> Earnings per common share		    0.22	     0.28</p>
<p>Weighted average number of</p>
<p>  common shares			    7,971,115	7,588,791</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
